    {
      "key": "b952f5fc-2329-4139-9679-c6adf320b0c4",
      "position": 1,
      "properties": {
        "description": "- Brief overview of what user testing is and its importance in game design.\n\n- Examples IRL on how player feedback can shape and improve games.",
        "name": "Video:"
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "b952f5fc-2329-4139-9679-c6adf320b0c4",
        "lesson_activity.key": "9eaf16fd-d9de-4ec9-add4-c6cc0f96f399"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "55cbf577-cf8c-4200-929b-d71e93b37c34",
      "position": 1,
      "properties": {
        "description": "- Include a hypothesis about the game, questions, and actions to watch for\n- Include trackable data suggestions\n   - Fun Level\n  - Difficulty Level\n  - Theme \n  - Game Mechanic Usability ",
        "name": "Provided Activity Guide"
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "55cbf577-cf8c-4200-929b-d71e93b37c34",
        "lesson_activity.key": "95ce1870-c9bb-4785-97ff-db4d7f013881"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "225ce051-f27d-4e9c-b9f2-2bf38406edf8",
      "position": 1,
      "properties": {
        "description": "- Suggestions on logistics \n  - Since they've made games in teams can they take turns obersving the user test and playing games?\n- How many user tests is enough data to find patterns? ",
        "name": "Classroom Arcade"
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "225ce051-f27d-4e9c-b9f2-2bf38406edf8",
        "lesson_activity.key": "04621dae-fe8b-48f4-b5e8-02491b3ec1f8"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "43e56b1c-7b6f-480d-b04c-76421d6e890d",
      "position": 1,
      "properties": {
        "description": "- Turn individual data into charts\n- Guided prompts and questions \n  - Which graph has the highest results? What can you conclude?\n  - Which graph has the lowest results? What can you conclude? \n  - What did you expect? What surprised you? \n  - What did you notice that wasn't collected on the graphs?\n  - What are the next steps to improve your game? \n\n",
        "name": "Review the user test data"
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "43e56b1c-7b6f-480d-b04c-76421d6e890d",
        "lesson_activity.key": "96e5ba2c-4278-456e-8929-f42f662e03d1"
      }
    },
